{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyone Fights</strong> is a turn-based strategy game where you build structures, recruit an army, and battle for land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502130/extras/53b467800aada3a97fbf9bc7247fe7cd.avif?t=1740122171\" data-has-big width=800 height=378 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>20 unique commanders</strong>, each with their own <strong>special unit, building, power, super, and trait</strong>. Command your army to victory through a series of campaigns to take over the world!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502130/extras/d7d00d5deb52d6544fc25b716a4355c4.avif?t=1740122171\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to capture enemy HQs while defending your own, whether battling AI, challenging friends, or playing through the <strong>campaign</strong>. Success requires managing both your army and city, building a powerful force to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a diverse array of units at your command, engage in tactical combat and adapt your strategy as the <strong>day and night cycle</strong> reshapes the fight. As visibility shifts and unit effectiveness changes from dawn to dusk, new challenges and opportunities emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502130/extras/e7bd21002500d9efa72494789c87fcdb.avif?t=1740122171\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get creative with the <strong>extensive level and character creators</strong>. Design custom maps with unique terrain and play styles. Craft your own commander\u2014whether it's a fun, unique character or the most powerful leader possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502130/extras/77a61b72e6ed1352a7858bc2a8751e2d.avif?t=1740122171\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your forces through <strong>four different campaigns</strong> in a war for global supremacy. Capture cities, unlock new characters, and battle for a world under your faction\u2019s banner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502130/extras/39ac50f438be441aea5e6ae6abd2a1c5.avif?t=1740122171\" width=78 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyone Fights</strong> gives a new city-building spin to the familiar turn-based war gaming genre. Try it out!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502130?t=1740122171","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740122171","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502130/b230093ecf813f3e840c66ffba27c1d5e4a9ff91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740122171","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502130/b230093ecf813f3e840c66ffba27c1d5e4a9ff91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740122171","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"deta